<tr><td>2</td><td>Map interface child</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>SortedMap interface</td><td>✗</td><td>✓</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td>Key order</td><td>No guaranteed order (hash-based)</td><td>Sorted by key (natural or Comparator)</td></tr>
